COMMENT
  Obligatory hello world program for Coral 66.

  Note there is no need for a COMMON communicator to import
  procedures etc. from the stdio library as its exported interface
  is exported via a COMMON communicator, thus you can use anything
  exported by the library directly.
;


LIBRARY ( stdio )

BEGIN
  newline;
  print("Hello World from Coral 66");
END;
